/Ratana_5416b7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Life Preserver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Preserver_6136c1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spiky Club\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiky_Club_19b080.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiquanda Corym Cave -1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"95\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Corym_Cave_1_f1bf09.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiquanda Corym Cave -2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"95\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Corym_Cave_2_2b0914.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiquanda Corym Cave -3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"118\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquanda_Corym_Cave_3_a7a028.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.80<br/>December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Tiquanda Corym Cave</b> is located just south of the city of <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>. The main entrance is west of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Training%20School\">Training School</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32607,32800,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32607, 32800, 7)</a>, but there are a number of alternative entrances scattered all over the plains between <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda%2FTrapwood\">Trapwood</a>.\n</p><p>There are three floors and much of the cave fits the jungle theme. Unlike the <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Corym%20Cave\">Venore Corym Cave</a>, this cave does not \"ease\" into the monsters: you are quite likely to drop down into a pack of coryms, even their toughest <a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Vanguard\">Corym Vanguard</a>. This can be particularly deadly if you do not intend to hunt coryms but are on your way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Dworcs\">Dworcs</a>, as they both have pitfalls leading to them. The corym cave pitfalls are more conspicuous than the dworc ones: their pitfalls are surrounded by different textured grass and they are never hidden under the jungle flora. As a general rule then: if you notice a pitfall, it will lead you to this cave, not dworcs.\n</p><p>Compared to its Venore counterpart there are pros and cons for hunting here. On the positive side, the Tiquanda cave is more densely populated, with less walk time per spawn and usually fairly large spawns. On the other hand, the Tiquanda cave is considerably smaller than the Venore one, the cave layout is more confusing and especially on the third floor, the cave has slow water tiles. The main reason one would want to hunt at the Tiquanda cave is its premium restriction.\n</p><p>As a knight of level 55 - 65 you can make good profit and experience (70k - 80k) when hunting here.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Charlatan\"><img alt=\"Corym Charlatan\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corym_Charlatan_5af294.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Charlatan\">Corym Charlatan</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-35× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Rat Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Soft Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bola (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Earflap (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cheese Cutter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Ratana (rare)</li>\n<li>Life Preserver (rare)</li>\n<li>Leather Harness (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheesy%20Figurine\">Cheesy Figurine</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Spike Shield (rare)</li>\n<li>Rat God Doll (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Skirmisher\"><img alt=\"Corym Skirmisher\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corym_Skirmisher_521c17.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Skirmisher\">Corym Skirmisher</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">260</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">450</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">240+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-45× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Rat Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Soft Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cheese Cutter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Earflap (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bola (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Life Preserver (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Ratana (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheesy%20Figurine\">Cheesy Figurine</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Spike Shield (rare)</li>\n<li>Leather Harness (rare)</li>\n<li>Rat God Doll (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Vanguard\"><img alt=\"Corym Vanguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corym_Vanguard_b5f822